# Terraform Module for S3 + RDS + IAM

I'll provide a complete modular Terraform implementation supporting dev/prod environments per the canonical scenario.

## Directory Structure

```
infrastructure/
├── modules/
│   ├── s3/
│   │   ├── main.tf
│   │   ├── variables.tf
│   │   └── outputs.tf
